1. Brief **principy** teaser (eyebrow + one balanced sentence)
2. Portrait (`/img/lucie-kralikova.jpg`, `home-print` tilt) + contact (name, email, phone, place) — stacked on phones; two columns from 801px
3. Full **Principy** essay + **Já** (no co-founder name)

